{"75:20":[{"type":"text","text":"Not "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[as you think, that you (mankind) will not be resurrected and recompensed for your deeds]"},{"type":"text","text":", but you "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(men)"},{"type":"text","text":" love the present life of this world,"}],"75:21":[{"type":"text","text":"And neglect the Hereafter."}],"75:22":[{"type":"text","text":"Some faces that Day shall be Nâdirah "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(shining and radiant)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"75:23":[{"type":"text","text":"Looking at their Lord "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Allâh)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"75:24":[{"type":"text","text":"And some faces, that Day, will be Bâsirah "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(dark, gloomy, frowning, and sad)"},{"type":"text","text":","}],"75:25":[{"type":"text","text":"Thinking that some calamity is about to fall on them."}],"75:26":[{"type":"text","text":"Nay, when "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the soul)"},{"type":"text","text":" reaches to the collar bone "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(i.e. up to the throat in its exit)"},{"type":"text","text":","}],"75:27":[{"type":"text","text":"And it will be said: \"Who can cure him "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(and save him from death)"},{"type":"text","text":"?\""}],"75:28":[{"type":"text","text":"And he "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the dying person)"},{"type":"text","text":" will conclude that it was "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the time)"},{"type":"text","text":" of parting "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(death)"},{"type":"text","text":";"}],"75:29":[{"type":"text","text":"And one leg will be joined with another leg "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(shrouded)"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"footnote","id":"155024","label":"1"}],"75:30":[{"type":"text","text":"The drive will be, on that Day, to your Lord "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Allâh)"},{"type":"text","text":"!"}],"75:31":[{"type":"text","text":"So he "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the disbeliever)"},{"type":"text","text":" neither believed "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(in this Qur’ân and in the Message of Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم)"},{"type":"text","text":" nor prayed!"}],"75:32":[{"type":"text","text":"But on the contrary, he belied "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(this Qur’ân and the Message of Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم)"},{"type":"text","text":" and turned away!"}],"75:33":[{"type":"text","text":"Then he walked in conceit "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(full pride)"},{"type":"text","text":" to his family admiring himself!"}],"75:34":[{"type":"text","text":"Woe to you "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[O man (disbeliever)]"},{"type":"text","text":"! And then "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(again)"},{"type":"text","text":" woe to you!"}],"75:35":[{"type":"text","text":"Again, woe to you "},{"type":"annotation","text":"[O man (disbeliever)]"},{"type":"text","text":"! And then "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(again)"},{"type":"text","text":" woe to you!"}],"75:36":[{"type":"text","text":"Does man think that he will be left neglected "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(without being punished or rewarded for the obligatory duties enjoined by his Lord Allâh on him)"},{"type":"text","text":"?"}],"75:37":[{"type":"text","text":"Was he not a Nutfah "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(mixed male and female sexual discharge)"},{"type":"text","text":" of semen emitted "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(poured forth)"},{"type":"text","text":"?"}],"75:38":[{"type":"text","text":"Then he became an ‘Alaqah "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(a clot)"},{"type":"text","text":"; then "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Allâh)"},{"type":"text","text":" shaped and fashioned "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(him)"},{"type":"text","text":" in due proportion."},{"type":"footnote","id":"155025","label":"1"}],"75:39":[{"type":"text","text":"And made of him two sexes, male and female."}],"75:40":[{"type":"text","text":"Is not He "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Allâh Who does that)"},{"type":"text","text":" Able to give life to the dead? "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(Yes! He is Able to do all things)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"76:1":[{"type":"text","text":"Has there not been over man a period of time, when he was not a thing worth mentioning?"}],"76:2":[{"type":"text","text":"Verily, We have created man from Nutfah "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(drops)"},{"type":"text","text":" of mixed semen "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(sexual discharge of man and woman)"},{"type":"text","text":", in order to try him: so We made him hearer and seer."}],"76:3":[{"type":"text","text":"Verily, We showed him the way, whether he be grateful or ungrateful."}],"76:4":[{"type":"text","text":"Verily, We have prepared for the disbelievers iron chains, iron collars, and a blazing Fire."}],"76:5":[{"type":"text","text":"Verily,, the Abrâr "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(the pious believers of Islamic Monotheism)"},{"type":"text","text":", shall drink of a cup "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(of wine)"},{"type":"text","text":" mixed with "},{"type":"annotation","text":"(water from a spring in Paradise called)"},{"type":"text","text":" Kâfûr"}]}